    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Several historical origins are compatible with the same engineering record.", "The source of an intuition is not an observable with a refuting outcome.";
